  "text": ">\nLocation:\nUltra Speaker Merge\n-\nUltra Speaker\nPrice:\nN/A\nMerge the following:\nGoddess Of War Blades\nx1\nGoddess of War Cloak\nx1\nSellback:\n0 AC\nRarity:\nChampion Rarity\nDescription:\nHammers may forge blades, but blades forge the future. The Goddess of War blesses those who face hardship and perservere in spite of it. Lore needs weapons to survive, and War needs Lore in order to have meaning.\nNotes:\nWhen equipped, this item provides a 30% bonus to Class Points, Gold and Reputation and does 30% more damage to\nChaos\n,\nDragon\n,\nElemental\n,\nHuman\n, and\nUndead\nmonsters.\nUsed to merge\nGoddess Of War\n.\nThanks to Amduscia.\nwindow['nitroAds'].createAd('wad-aqwwiki-below-content', {\n  \"refreshTime\": 30,\n  \"renderVisibleOnly\": false,\n  \"refreshVisibleOnly\": true,\n  \"sizes\": [ [ 300, 250 ] ],\n  \"report\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"wording\": \"Report Ad\",\n    \"position\": \"bottom-right\"\n  }\n  });\n0ac\n_g\nac\nanimated\nback\nbackweapon\ncape\ncpboost\nfreeplayer\ngoldboost\nioda-excl\nmergeitem\nmergereward\nrepboost\nshopitem\nspectral\nxdmg2chaos\nxdmg2dragon\nxdmg2elemental\nxdmg2human\nxdmg2undead",
